  "details": "I'm not asking for limitless range senders, though that would be very nice.\n\nAnd I know most people will not often need to go over the limit that is currently set. \n\nBut I like to make battle systems with grand abilities, obviously I want them to deal damage befitting of the scale of a attack.\n\nExample:\n\nRight now for a large explosion I have to essentially spam 16 senders, then animate them to go over the radius of said attack. \n\nIf the upper limit of contact senders was doubled it'd already be a lot of help.\n\nI hope there is a possibility for senders to have less limitations on the scale of them.",
